; DOMAIN: ribet-level-lowering [CLOSED, derived 2026-07-25]
; Claim: Ribet's theorem (the epsilon-conjecture of Serre) states that if f is a weight-2 newform of level Nq whose mod-p Galois representation rho-bar_{f,p} is irreducible and unramified at q (i.e. the ramification at q is only apparent, arising from the extra level q), then rho-bar_{f,p} also arises from a newform g of level N (level q is stripped). Formally: a mod-p modular form of level Nq gives, after level-lowering, a mod-p modular form of level N whenever the local condition at q is satisfied. Applied to the Frey curve E: y^2 = x(x-a^p)(x+b^p) attached to a hypothetical FLT solution a^p+b^p=c^p, modularity (Taylor-Wiles) makes rho-bar_{E,p} modular of level = conductor (product of primes dividing abc), while its ramification is minimal (semistable, and the p-th-power structure kills ramification mod p); Ribet level-lowering then descends it to level 2. But S_2(Gamma_0(2)) = 0 (no weight-2 cusp forms of level 2), a contradiction — hence no FLT solution exists: Fermat's Last Theorem.
; Bridge: genesis_taylor_wiles (R=T modularity makes the Frey curve's rho-bar_{E,p} modular of some level N, the input Ribet then lowers) + genesis_galois_representation (level-lowering is a statement about the mod-p representation rho-bar_{f,p} being unramified at q and hence realizable at lower level) + genesis_hecke_algebra (source and target are Hecke eigenforms/eigensystems; level-lowering is a congruence between Hecke eigensystems at levels Nq and N).
(= (newform-level $f) (level $f))
(= (mod-p-rep $f) (rho-bar $f $p))
(= (unramified-at $f $q) (locally-unramified (mod-p-rep $f) $q))
(= (level-lowering $f $q) (if (and (irreducible (mod-p-rep $f)) (unramified-at $f $q)) (exists-newform $g (and (equal (mod-p-rep $g) (mod-p-rep $f)) (equal (level $g) (quotient (level $f) $q)))) nil))
(= (frey-curve $a $b $c $p) (elliptic-curve (times X (times (minus X (pow $a $p)) (plus X (pow $b $p))))))
(= (frey-modular $a $b $c $p) (modular (mod-p-rep (frey-curve $a $b $c $p))))
(= (lowered-to-level-2 $a $b $c $p) (level-lowering (frey-curve $a $b $c $p) (odd-primes-dividing (times $a (times $b $c)))))
(= (no-weight2-level2) (equal (cusp-forms 2 2) empty))
(= (flt-contradiction) (and (lowered-to-level-2 $a $b $c $p) (no-weight2-level2)))
(= (fermat-last-theorem) (implies (flt-contradiction) (not (exists-solution (equal (plus (pow $a $p) (pow $b $p)) (pow $c $p))))))